<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="BP04_CaptureAndCurateIdeas" targetNamespace="http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collaboration_BP04_CaptureAndCurateIdeas">
    <bpmn:participant id="Participant_User" name="User" processRef="Process_User" />
    <bpmn:participant id="Participant_Bearing" name="Bearing" processRef="Process_Bearing" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_1" name="BP04.02 · Edit an idea" sourceRef="T_5" targetRef="editIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_2" name="BP04.05 · Reorder ideas" sourceRef="T_7" targetRef="reorderIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_3" name="BP04.06 · See what archiving an idea takes" sourceRef="T_9" targetRef="archImpactIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_4" name="BP04.07 · Archive an idea" sourceRef="T_12" targetRef="archiveIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_5" name="BP04.08 · See what deleting an idea takes" sourceRef="T_15" targetRef="delImpactIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_6" name="BP04.09 · Delete an idea" sourceRef="T_18" targetRef="deleteIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_7" name="BP04.11 · Define a goal" sourceRef="T_22" targetRef="goalIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_8" name="BP04.12 · Create a project" sourceRef="T_25" targetRef="projectIn" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_9" name="The editing outcome" sourceRef="T_30" targetRef="recorded" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_10" name="The ordering outcome" sourceRef="T_33" targetRef="reordered" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_11" name="What the archiving will take" sourceRef="T_35" targetRef="archImpact" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_12" name="The archiving outcome" sourceRef="T_38" targetRef="archived" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_13" name="What the deletion will take" sourceRef="T_40" targetRef="delImpact" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_14" name="The deletion outcome" sourceRef="T_44" targetRef="deleted" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_15" name="The editing outcome" sourceRef="T_49" targetRef="goalDefined" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="MF_16" name="The editing outcome" sourceRef="T_54" targetRef="projectCreated" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X1"><bpmn:text>What is typed drafts as it is filled in, the notes included, and the draft survives a crash and a restart. Submitting is the commit.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X1" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="T_4" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X1" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X2"><bpmn:text>The archive is reached by an explicit act. Reading it, bringing one back and destroying one out of it are its own process (BP15).</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X2" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="T_27" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X2" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X3"><bpmn:text>The order groups related ideas. It carries no priority.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X3" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="reordered" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X3" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X4"><bpmn:text>A theme is optional, and a theme-less idea is grouped under Unthemed. An archived idea is not editable.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X4" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="recorded" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X4" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X5"><bpmn:text>The goal's editor opens on the idea, with the idea already linked. A goal needs a theme, so one defined on a theme-less idea is refused with its reason. Maintaining the goal afterwards is its own process (BP05).</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X5" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="goalDefined" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X5" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X6"><bpmn:text>A project carries one optional parent, and the idea is it here. Working its board (BP11), or laying its course out (BP18), is its own process.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X6" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="projectCreated" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X6" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X7"><bpmn:text>Nothing below a project can be left behind, so the gesture is approve-or-abandon.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X7" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="T_35" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X7" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X8"><bpmn:text>Keeping a project behind is not offered. A goal that links the idea survives minus the link.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X8" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="T_40" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X8" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X9"><bpmn:text>The theme may be absent. An archived idea is not editable.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X9" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="T_29" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X9" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X10"><bpmn:text>The idea comes in as one of the ideas behind the goal. A theme-less idea gives the goal no theme, and a goal without one is refused, which is the same answer the Goals view's own editor gives.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X10" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="Gw_46" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X10" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X11"><bpmn:text>The parent is the idea, carried in from where the user started. The kind is declared once and for the project's life.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X11" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="T_51" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X11" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X12"><bpmn:text>Unarchiving restores the whole bundle.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X12" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="T_37" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X12" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_X13"><bpmn:text>A goal left with no linked idea is flagged on its current state.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_X13" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="T_42" targetRef="TextAnnotation_X13" />
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_User" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_1" name="An idea worth keeping, or a list worth tidying">
